<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4 Entity-specific Challenges in Multilingual Multicultural Benchmark Construction ‣ Camellia : Benchmarking Cultural Biases in LLMs for Asian Languages" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Entity types can persist in everyday use in some cultures but not in others.</span></a></li>
